  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall provide two bee bricks and two swift boxes close to the eaves prior to first occupation and shall be retained as such in perpetuity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interest of biodiversity.&lt;/p&gt;",
